WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.814
Let's install Cart Progress in the Fieldnote demo
store. This widget shows how close a cart is to a

2
00:00:06.814 --> 00:00:07.531
spending reward.

3
00:00:07.881 --> 00:00:14.202
Our example campaign already exists: spend thirty-six
dollars and receive ten percent off. The widget

4
00:00:14.202 --> 00:00:17.994
explains that offer; it does not create the discount.

5
00:00:19.044 --> 00:00:26.347
In Online Store, open the theme editor and select the
Cart template. We are using an unpublished recording

6
00:00:26.347 --> 00:00:28.781
copy, leaving the original theme unchanged.

7
00:00:29.131 --> 00:00:35.359
In a section that supports app blocks, choose Add
block, Apps, and Cart Progress. Place it above the

8
00:00:35.359 --> 00:00:38.473
cart items so shoppers can see the next reward.

9
00:00:38.823 --> 00:00:45.641
Save the theme, then preview that same draft. You can
adjust the appearance later. Start by checking the

10
00:00:45.641 --> 00:00:49.050
offer and the amounts, rather than changing technical
selectors.

11
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:56.559
Start with an empty test cart. Add one Coral notebook,
priced at twenty-four dollars, and open the cart.

12
00:00:56.909 --> 00:01:03.974
The widget asks for twelve dollars more to unlock ten
percent off. Twenty-four plus twelve reaches our

13
00:01:03.974 --> 00:01:07.299
thirty-six dollar threshold. No discount is applied
yet.

14
00:01:08.349 --> 00:01:14.682
Add one Sun notebook for twelve dollars. The
qualifying merchandise subtotal is now thirty-six

15
00:01:14.682 --> 00:01:18.301
dollars, and the widget shows ten percent unlocked.

16
00:01:18.651 --> 00:01:25.167
The actual discounted merchandise amount is thirty-two
dollars and forty cents. The qualifying subtotal and

17
00:01:25.167 --> 00:01:28.208
the amount to pay are different values.

18
00:01:28.558 --> 00:01:35.254
The campaign's own discount must not make the progress
bar ask for another three dollars and sixty cents.

19
00:01:35.254 --> 00:01:37.859
Check that the unlocked state stays visible.

20
00:01:38.909 --> 00:01:45.357
Open checkout and compare both notebooks, their
quantities and the ten percent discount. The

21
00:01:45.357 --> 00:01:49.041
merchandise subtotal remains thirty-two dollars and
forty cents.

22
00:01:49.391 --> 00:01:56.246
Delivery and taxes can affect the final total. We do
not enter customer or payment details, and we do not

23
00:01:56.246 --> 00:01:57.274
place an order.

24
00:01:58.324 --> 00:02:04.464
Back in the cart, remove the Sun notebook. The
qualifying amount returns to twenty-four dollars, and

25
00:02:04.464 --> 00:02:07.150
the widget asks for twelve dollars again.

26
00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:14.632
Add the Sun notebook once more. The reward unlocks
again, with just one row per notebook and the same

27
00:02:14.632 --> 00:02:15.382
discounted amount.

28
00:02:15.732 --> 00:02:22.082
Remove the test items when you finish. Check your
theme on a phone as well, and keep it unpublished

29
00:02:22.082 --> 00:02:25.423
until the widget, cart and checkout all match the
campaign.
